---
import Layout from "@layouts/Layout.astro";
import CenteredHero from "@components/CenteredHero.astro";
import StandardBlock from "@components/StandardBlock.astro";
import heroImage from "@assets/heroes/malue-home-hero.png";
import image1 from "@assets/background.svg";
---

<Layout>
  <CenteredHero
    titleHtml="Helping healthcare <span class='highlight'>adopt</span> what works"
    description="Malue is building an incentivised decision intelligence platform for healthcare and regulated sectors. Designed to help organisations capture frontline experience, structure evidence and support the adoption of better ways of working."
    primaryText="Partner With Us"
    primaryHref="/partner"
    secondaryText="Learn More"
    secondaryHref="/about"
    imageAlt="Illustration of growth and collaboration"
    imageSrc={heroImage}
  />

  <StandardBlock
    imageSrc={image1}
    imageAlt="Hero image"
    alignBody="left"
    alignText="left"
    linkText="Read about us"
    linkURL="./about/"
    textMarkdown="## From promising idea to **measurable improvement**
Malue helps healthcare teams explore, test and adopt changes that improve services. Our work has supported major equipment procurement, real-time professional engagement, sustainable clinical alternatives and new workforce models.  

Each collaboration addresses a practical partner need while strengthening a reusable improvement capability, bringing together stakeholder insight, evidence, governance, implementation planning and impact measurement in one place."
  />

  <StandardBlock
    alignBody="center"
    alignText="center"
    linkText="Read about what we do"
    linkURL="./what-we-do/"
    textMarkdown="## The **Malue** Loop
  A connected platform loop that moves improvement from insight through to measurable, adopted value.
  
  # LOOP GRAPHIC HERE

  The answers to many healthcare operational challenges already exist within the system. Clinicians see what fits workflow. Procurement teams understand decision risk. Patients experience the consequences of service design. Industry partners see where products can help. Operational leaders understand the pressure on cost, capacity and performance."
  />

  <StandardBlock
    imageSrc={image1}
    imageAlt="Hero image"
    alignBody="right"
    alignText="left"
    linkText="Read about how we work"
    linkURL="./how-we-work/"
    textMarkdown="## How **we work**
Malue is designed to create commercial value and social value together. The company purpose is to help healthcare systems use resources more intelligently, improve adoption of valuable innovation, reduce waste, support sustainability and recognise the people whose work creates improvement. As Malue matures commercially, the company aims to reinvest a portion of value into healthcare improvement activity aligned with its mission."
  />
</Layout>
